<%# A single combined scholarship cell: award count stacked over its dollars,
    each linked to the registrations behind it. `count`, `cents`; `start:` draws
    the group's left divider; `emphasis:` bolds the count for a training's Total
    column; `filters:`, `event:`, `year:` pass through to scholarship_figure_link. %>
<td class="border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-right<%= " border-l-2 border-l-fuchsia-200" if start %>">
  <div class="<%= emphasis ? "font-semibold text-gray-900" : "text-gray-900" %>"><%= scholarship_figure_link(count, count, filters, event: event, year: year) %></div>
  <div class="text-xs text-gray-500"><%= scholarship_figure_link(dollars_from_cents(cents), cents, filters, event: event, year: year) %></div>
</td>
